    /// <summary>
    /// Note that in this context what can be enumerated is the MIDI interfaces. This includes most devices connected to the host computer with USB, since USB-MIDI devices typically have their own MIDI interface and would be enumerated. An individual sampler or synthesizer MIDI device plugged into a MIDI interface with a 5-pin DIN cable would not be enumerated. The interfaces that could be fingerprinted are equivalent to MIDI &quot;ports&quot;, and for each MIDI interface the API will expose the name of the device, manufacturer, and opaque identifier of the MIDI interface.
    /// </summary>
